  "storage.near": "This device's storage for Go Coach is {pct} full. It is shared by every account on this device, and the chat history takes the most room. When it is full, Go Coach stops keeping your progress. To make room, clear your chat history, or delete accounts that are no longer used: each player can delete only their own account (Clear Account in Settings).",
  "storage.full-title": "Storage is full",
  "storage.full-note": "This device's storage for Go Coach is full ({pct}), so Go Coach has stopped keeping your progress, games and chat. What would you like to do?",
